Firewall Map+ bundles deck.gl, luma.gl and their dependencies (MIT License,
https://github.com/visgl/deck.gl). The bundled world-boundary dataset is
derived from the Natural Earth public-domain dataset.

When DB-IP Lite is selected as geolocation source, the downloaded databases
are "IP Geolocation by DB-IP" (https://db-ip.com), licensed under CC BY 4.0.
MaxMind GeoLite2 databases are downloaded with your own license key and are
subject to the MaxMind GeoLite2 End User License Agreement.
